<title>FRANCE: Lamassoure - euro &quot;stability pact&quot; making progress.</title>
<headline>Lamassoure - euro &quot;stability pact&quot; making progress.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>French government spokesman Alain Lamassoure said on Wednesday talks on a budgetary discipline pact for countries in the euro, the so-called &quot;stability pact&quot; were advancing.</p>
<p>Questioned by reporters after the Wednesday weekly cabinet meeting briefing, Lamassoure said: &quot;The talks are progressing&quot;.</p>
<p>The budgetary discipline pact is a key issue for the Dublin summit of EU leaders on Friday and Saturday and finance ministers hope to clear the way for a solution on the German-proposed pact at a preparatory meeting in Dublin on Thursday.</p>
</text>
